<title>HUNGARY: Dunaholding cuts H1 net loss to HUF 96mln.</title>
<headline>Dunaholding cuts H1 net loss to HUF 96mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Jan-June 1997     Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating loss		 267.7	  vs     412.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss		    95.6	  vs     876.5</p>
<p>    After-tax loss		  96.1	  vs     877.4</p>
<p>    Net sales		    3,313.3	  vs   3,309.1</p>
<p>     Domestic sales	    3,124.2	  vs   3,167.6</p>
<p>     Export sales		  189.1	  vs     141.6</p>
<p>    Material expenditure     2,719.9	  vs   2,453.8</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditure	566.7	  vs     492.7</p>
<p>    Depreciation		   107.7	  vs     109.3</p>
<p>    Other costs		    259.5	  vs     338.8</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	   104.2	  vs     236.8</p>
<p>    Net financial result	  92.5 profit vs     476.9 loss</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income    79.7	  vs	12.5</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue    111.3	  vs	21.3</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expend.     31.6	  vs	 8.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Dunaholding Rt. The figures are consolidated, unaudited and were calculated according to the Hungarian accounting standard. The company said in a statement that its losses fell due to decreasing costs and the profit from securities trading.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
